    "en": {
      "trackName": "Rotational: Color Block Puzzle",
      "description": "Spin the rings. Match the colors. Clear the board.\n\nRotational is a fast, original color-matching puzzle. Blocks appear around the centre and fall outwards onto rings of color. Drag around the rings to turn them so each block lands next to its own color – every touching group of two or more disappears. Match again on your next drop to build your multiplier; miss and it resets.\n\nDAILY PUZZLE\nA new board every day, the same for every player in the world. Clear it as fast as you can, compare your time on the daily leaderboard and keep your streak going.\n\nShare your result as a row of coloured dots – one for every move – without giving the board away.\n\nFIVE WAYS TO PLAY\n• Daily Puzzle – one shared board a day (free)\n• Continuous – endless play that speeds up every level (free)\n• Calm – no clock: line up every drop at your own pace\n• Puzzle – clear a packed board against the clock\n• Time Attack – score as much as you can in 60 seconds\n\nCalm, Puzzle and Time Attack unlock with one small purchase. No ads, no subscriptions, no tracking.\n\nPLAY IT YOUR WAY\n• iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple TV – buy once, play on all four\n• On Apple Watch, turn the Digital Crown to spin the rings, click by click\n• On Apple TV, circle your thumb on the Siri Remote to spin the rings\n• Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets keep your streak in view\n• Game controller and keyboard support\n• Plays offline – no Wi-Fi needed\n• Game Center leaderboards and achievements\n• Optional color-blind shapes on every block\n• Haptics and the original sound effects\n\nRotational first launched in 2013. Version 2 is a complete rebuild for today's iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple TV, with the same simple, addictive rules.",
      "releaseNotes": "Rotational is back, rebuilt from scratch.\n• New Daily Puzzle: one shared board a day, with streaks, a daily leaderboard and a result you can share\n• New Calm mode: no clock, so you can line up every drop\n• Now on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple TV – turn the Digital Crown or circle the Siri Remote to spin\n• Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets, color-blind shapes, haptics and smooth 120 Hz play\n• No more ads. Continuous and the Daily Puzzle are free; Calm, Puzzle and Time Attack are a one-time unlock\nIf you played the original, every mode is already unlocked for you.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/rotational-color-block-puzzle/id686485239?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
